1.3
===
- BREAKING (linux rpmsg compat): rpmsg spi protocol update
A new (common) init field was added so protocol version was updated,
and m33 update will require a linux update.
- spi: implement lpspi for spi[0-3]
- suspend: implement underdrive control for m33 core, and add a new
'active_ud' mode to automatically enter underdrive when linux sleeps
- suspend/wdog: implement m33-side wdog handover for when linux suspend
in active* mode
- wdog: refactor out of app_srtm.c and implement wdog for uboot, so
failure to boot linux will reset
- hardfault handler: implement minimum uboot protocol handling to
allow uboot relocation and rollback in case of early hardfault
- custom: add more custom hooks for easier prototyping
- gpio: refactor with custom consumers in mind.
- suspend: fix suspend in deep sleep for >24h. This used to require
a hard reset because the sentinel wdog timer apparently was not suspended
during deep sleep.

  - 2025-06-23

1.2
===
- dac/audio services
- flexio support baudrate change
- (mostly) fix A core voltage not being lowered during suspend

  -- 2025-05-26

1.1.1
===========
- add spi rpmsg implementation
- only log wdog ping once after init (boot/resume)
- fix rare reboot loop on sd boot (secure enclave reset loop)

  -- 2025-04-14

1.0
===
Initial release for Armadillo 900

